Exported ONNX models land here. The contents are gitignored — see .gitignore.

Generate an untrained smoke model to exercise the serving path:

    python ml/src/export_onnx.py --random --num-classes 8

Export a real one once you have a checkpoint:

    python ml/src/export_onnx.py --checkpoint ml/runs/word-v1/best.pt

This directory must exist for the Docker build (`COPY models/ ./models/`).
